lysis is having the correct email marketing key metrics.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Email marketing key performance indicators (KPIs) measure the performance of different aspects of marketing campaigns. You can gain profound insights into business by tracking KPIs through email. By monitoring these KPIs, companies can tweak their strategies to meet their goals and connect with their audience.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can truly understand your <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/target-audience\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">target audience<\/a> by monitoring and evaluating your email marketing KPI. This understanding allows you to build on what works, eliminate what doesn&#8217;t, and improve your strategy.<\/p>\n\n\n\n    <!-- LOTTIE SCRIPT -->\n    <script src=\"https:\/\/unpkg.com\/@lottiefiles\/lottie-player@latest\/dist\/lottie-player.js\"><\/script>\n\n    <section class=\"wscube-courses mb-2\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h3 class=\"mb-4\">Recommended Professional <\/br> Certificates<\/h3>\n\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel courseOwl\">\n\n                \n                    \n                    <div class=\"course-card card-r rounded-4\">\n\n                        <!-- \u2705 SINGLE MEDIA DIV (FIXED) -->\n                        <div class=\"course-media\"\n                             data-lottie=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/uploads\/images\/courses\/json-images\/digital-marketing.json\"\n                             data-fallback=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/themes\/newwscube\/assets\/imges\/Image.png\">\n                        <\/div>\n\n                        <div class=\"card-body\">\n                            <h5>AI-Powered Digital Marketing Course<\/h5>\n\n                            <p class=\"rating\">\n                                4.9 \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n                                (19476)\n                            <\/p>\n\n                            <ul cl